## Constraints

- **The Pi 3B+ cannot run speech recognition locally.** 1 GB RAM, no NPU. All transcription, translation, and speech synthesis happens in the cloud. Do not try to run Whisper on the device.
- **Network is an iPhone hotspot.** It can be slow and can drop. Every network call needs a timeout and a clean failure path.
- **16 kHz mono is enough.** That's the speech band these models expect. Don't record at higher rates "for quality" — it just makes uploads slower.
- **No screen.** The LEDs are the entire user interface.

