## Device access

```
ssh box_tech@BOXtech.local
```

The Pi only looks for wifi when it boots, so the hotspot must be on before the Pi powers up.

Always shut down properly before unplugging:

```bash
sudo shutdown -h now
```

Wait for the green LED to go dark. Pulling power while it's writing corrupts the SD card.